                          "heading": "CS205: Discrete Mathematics for Computer Science"
                        },
                        "ordered": false,
                        "items": [
                          {
                            "text": "Description:\nMathematical foundations including logic, set theory, combinatorics, graph theory, and proofs relevant to computer science applications.",
                            "depth": 0
